  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional dialogue and Intra-Palestinian reconciliation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This 18-month action will contain two components which underpin the European Joint Strategy (EJS) in support of Palestine 2021-2024. The first component will include close work with the European Union&#xbf;s Special Representative for the Middle East Peace Process (EUSR MEPP) on reviving the peace process, through facilitation of dialogue to support intra-Palestinian reconciliation, as well as regular engagements between high-level regional experts to garner input for a comprehensive regional peace process, including a specific expert group of women from the region. The aim of the second&amp;nbsp;component is to contribute to decreasing and preventing escalations of conflict related to water and energy scarcity. &amp;nbsp;This component will include dialogue activities on the topic of renewable energy and water-energy exchange mechanisms between Israel, Palestine and Jordan in order to ease investments in green initiatives, access to self-sufficient water and energy, and address challenges posed by climate change.&amp;nbsp;</narrative>
  </description>
